ctionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘까지만","audio":"/audio/2fc0b7a52a41729e61d2.mp3"}},{"text":"보내면","meaning":"发送","explanation":"보내다：发送；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"10","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보내면","audio":"/audio/0e7109fc6fa3f22e49ef.mp3"}},{"text":"되는","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되는","audio":"/audio/71a6291359a47833529f.mp3"}},{"text":"겁니까?","meaning":"是……吗？（确认做法）","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末；겁니까 是 것입니까 的缩略；-는 겁니까? 在此确认前述做法是否成立。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"겁니까","audio":"/audio/a3f4253cbba84da22f8a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"发送","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"使内容被传达。","pronunciation":["보내다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/d2f25f1a9fcd1a125ca1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.307,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75767","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/li